    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "another night of just staring at the neon through the grime on the window. honestly kael, i dont even know why i keep waking up to this. it's just the same cycle. the noise, the smog, the debt... it never actually stops. it's just a slow rot. i'm just so tired of fighting for a life that doesn't even feel like mine.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
